le check w/ team):** If supervision extension occurs within 15 days of a technical violation disposition date, then we are considering the supervision extension to be a result of the violation. Does this make sense?\n\n**Current N with this business rule:** 1,032 (compare to disposition counts above)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## Table 7. By FY: Average Length of Supervision Extension\n\n**NOTE:** The base sample and denominator for this analysis is all filed violations where the most serious violation was a technical violation. FY represents fiscal year of violation file date.\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> FY of Violation </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> All Technical Violations w/ Supervision Extensions (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Median </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Mean </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Min </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Max </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2016 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 71 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 364.0 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 450.8767 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 310 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 925 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2017 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 194 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 364.0 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 371.1561 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 97 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,095 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2018 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 250 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 364.0 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 338.6022 </td>